+    # exploitOverflow()'s `claripy.BVS("input", 400 * 8)`), not a tightly
+    # fit payload — the actual win-function address sits wherever the real
+    # overflow offset put it, followed by zero-padding out to 400 bytes.
+    # So the insertion point has to be found by locating the address's own
